{"seq":2,"slug":"industry-license-precondition","title":"行业资质与前置经营许可（联109）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/business-account-qualification/industry-license-precondition","wordCount":2310,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"行业资质与前置经营许可-联109\">行业资质与前置经营许可（联109）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><a href=\"../business-identity-verification/charter-business-scope-match\">公司章程/经营范围与开店类目比对</a> 解决了&quot;经营范围是否覆盖这个类目&quot;，本篇解决另一件事：<strong>这个类目本身是否需要一张许可证</strong>。两者的关系容易被混淆——经营范围是公司的能力声明，前置许可是<strong>进入某个行业必须持有的法定凭证</strong>。一家经营范围写了&quot;食品销售&quot;的公司，如果没有食品经营许可证，它依然不能卖食品；反过来，许可证持有人如果经营范围不含对应条款，同样是资质断裂。</p>\n<p>工程上的核心问题是<strong>把&quot;资质要求&quot;表达成可判定的规则</strong>，而不是散落在审核员脑子里的经验。因此本篇的主线是：类目 → 资质要求的映射、资质凭证的结构化与核验、有效期的生命周期管理、以及&quot;缺资质&quot;该拦还是该补。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[目标类目] --&gt; B[资质要求表]&#10;  B --&gt; C{该市场是否要求资质?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[放行]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[列出必需资质类型]&#10;  E --&gt; F{商家已提交?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[补件: 要求提交]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[凭证核验]&#10;  H --&gt; H1[发证机关真实性]&#10;  H --&gt; H2[主体名称一致]&#10;  H --&gt; H3[范围覆盖类目]&#10;  H --&gt; H4[有效期覆盖当前]&#10;  H1 --&gt; I{全部通过?}&#10;  H2 --&gt; I&#10;  H3 --&gt; I&#10;  H4 --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[通过 + 记入资质台账]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[拒绝 或 受限放行]&#10;  J --&gt; L[到期前预警与重验]\">graph TD\n  A[目标类目] --&gt; B[资质要求表]\n  B --&gt; C{该市场是否要求资质?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[放行]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[列出必需资质类型]\n  E --&gt; F{商家已提交?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[补件: 要求提交]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[凭证核验]\n  H --&gt; H1[发证机关真实性]\n  H --&gt; H2[主体名称一致]\n  H --&gt; H3[范围覆盖类目]\n  H --&gt; H4[有效期覆盖当前]\n  H1 --&gt; I{全部通过?}\n  H2 --&gt; I\n  H3 --&gt; I\n  H4 --&gt; I\n  I --&gt;|是| J[通过 + 记入资质台账]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[拒绝 或 受限放行]\n  J --&gt; L[到期前预警与重验]</pre><h2 id=\"资质要求的建模\">资质要求的建模</h2><h3 id=\"三层映射-司法管辖区-类目-商家角色\">三层映射：司法管辖区 × 类目 × 商家角色</h3><p>资质要求不是类目的属性，而是**&quot;在哪个市场、卖什么、以什么角色卖&quot;**三元组的属性。同一个商品，本地制造商与跨境卖家承担的义务不同，平台如果是分销链条的一环承担的义务又不同。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;requirement_id&quot;: &quot;req_EU_GPSR_manufacturer_nonEU&quot;,&#10;  &quot;jurisdiction&quot;: &quot;EU&quot;,&#10;  &quot;category_codes&quot;: [&quot;consumer-electronics&quot;, &quot;toys&quot;, &quot;personal-care&quot;],&#10;  &quot;seller_roles&quot;: [&quot;manufacturer&quot;, &quot;importer&quot;],&#10;  &quot;required_credential_types&quot;: [&quot;EU_ECONOMIC_OPERATOR&quot;],&#10;  &quot;legal_basis&quot;: &quot;Regulation (EU) 2023/988&quot;,&#10;  &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;block&quot;,&#10;  &quot;grace_period_days&quot;: 0,&#10;  &quot;evidence_schema&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;operator_name&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;    &quot;operator_address&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;    &quot;operator_email&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;    &quot;iso_country&quot;: { &quot;const&quot;: &quot;EU&quot; },&#10;    &quot;role&quot;: { &quot;enum&quot;: [&quot;importer&quot;, &quot;distributor&quot;, &quot;authorised_representative&quot;] }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"requirement_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"req_EU_GPSR_manufacturer_nonEU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"jurisdiction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"category_codes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"consumer-electronics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"toys\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"personal-care\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"seller_roles\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"manufacturer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"importer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"required_credential_types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU_ECONOMIC_OPERATOR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"legal_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Regulation (EU) 2023/988\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"block\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"grace_period_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence_schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"operator_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"operator_address\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"operator_email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"iso_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"const\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"enum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"importer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"distributor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"authorised_representative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>severity</code> 与 <code>grace_period_days</code> 是这一层的两个关键设计。前者区分<strong>硬门槛</strong>（缺了就卖不了）与<strong>软要求</strong>（可放行但标记），后者给跨境的资质过渡留出窗口——很多国家的许可证制度更新后有新旧衔接期，把过渡期硬编码在核验逻辑里会导致历史商家被批量误伤。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么要有-本地代表-这一类资质\">为什么要有&quot;本地代表&quot;这一类资质</h3><p>跨境场景里最特殊的一类&quot;资质&quot;不是许可证，而是<strong>本地代表的指定</strong>。它没有传统意义上的证号，却构成准入的硬前提：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>欧盟《通用产品安全条例》(EU) 2023/988</strong> 自 2024 年 12 月 13 日起适用于投放市场的产品，要求非欧盟制造商指定一个<strong>欧盟境内的经济运营者</strong>（可以是欧盟进口商、分销商或授权代表），由其持有并维护产品技术文档、配合欧盟市场监管机构、充当合规咨询的官方联络点；<strong>若未指定，进口商或分销商自动承担产品合规的法律责任</strong>。产品上必须标示制造商的名称、注册商号或商标、<strong>邮政地址与电子邮箱地址</strong>，以及产品标识（如型号、批次或序列号）；线上销售的商品页必须展示制造商或欧盟授权代表的详细信息、产品识别信息（包括图片）以及相关警告或安全信息（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Product_Safety_Regulation\">General Product Safety Regulation</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>欧盟进口一站式服务（IOSS）</strong> 同样要求非欧盟企业参与时必须使用<strong>欧盟境内的中介</strong>（税务代表），且该机制仅覆盖价值 <strong>0–150 欧元</strong>的低价值进口商品；IOSS 自 2021 年 7 月 1 日起可用，企业自 2021 年 4 月 1 日起可注册（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Import_One-Stop_Shop\">Import One-Stop Shop</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这两条把&quot;本地代表&quot;从商务安排变成了<strong>平台的合规前提</strong>：对于平台而言，&quot;未指定欧盟经济运营者&quot;不只是商家的瑕疵，而是平台自身在接受一份它无法履行的合规责任。因此 <code>EU_ECONOMIC_OPERATOR</code> 应当被建成与许可证同级的一等资质类型，参与同一套核验与到期管理流程。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资质类型</th>\n<th>是否有证号</th>\n<th>核验对象</th>\n<th>失效形态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行业经营许可证</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>发证机关登记库</td>\n<td>吊销、到期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特定商品注册号（如化妆品通报号）</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>官方通报系统</td>\n<td>撤销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地经济运营者指定</td>\n<td>无（有名称地址）</td>\n<td>运营者身份 + 地址</td>\n<td>关系终止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税务代表/中介</td>\n<td>注册号</td>\n<td>税务登记库</td>\n<td>注销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行业会员/自律认证</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>行业协会</td>\n<td>除名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"资质凭证的结构化核验\">资质凭证的结构化核验</h2><h3 id=\"四个必须通过的检查\">四个必须通过的检查</h3><p>一份提交上来的许可证，无论来自哪个国家，核验都可以拆成四个正交的检查：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>发证机关真实性</strong>——证号在发证机关的公开查询渠道中能否查到，且返回的持有人与本商家一致。这一步不能只看影像，影像可以完美但号码是编的。</li>\n<li><strong>主体名称一致</strong>——许可证上的持有人名称必须与法人主键对应主体一致（按 <a href=\"corporate-bank-account-ownership\">对公银行账户归属验证</a> 同样的规范化与分级匹配逻辑处理）。</li>\n<li><strong>范围覆盖类目</strong>——许可证的业务范围必须覆盖商家要卖的类目。注意这里是<strong>许可证范围</strong>而不是经营范围，两者是不同的字段。</li>\n<li><strong>有效期覆盖当前</strong>——许可证在审批时点与预计的经营期间内有效。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE merchant_credential (&#10;  credential_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  legal_entity_key TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  credential_type TEXT NOT NULL,          -- &#39;INDUSTRY_LICENSE&#39; | &#39;EU_ECONOMIC_OPERATOR&#39; | ...&#10;  jurisdiction    CHAR(2) NOT NULL,       -- ISO 3166-1 alpha-2&#10;  issuer          TEXT,&#10;  credential_no   TEXT,&#10;  scope_codes     TEXT[],                 -- 覆盖的类目/行业范围&#10;  issued_at       DATE,&#10;  expires_at      DATE,&#10;  status          TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;pending&#39;,&#10;                  -- &#39;pending&#39;|&#39;verified&#39;|&#39;rejected&#39;|&#39;expired&#39;|&#39;revoked&#39;&#10;  verified_checks JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;::jsonb,&#10;  evidence_refs   TEXT[],&#10;  created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX ON merchant_credential (legal_entity_key, credential_type, status);&#10;CREATE INDEX ON merchant_credential (expires_at) WHERE status = &#39;verified&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merchant_credential</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  credential_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_entity_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  credential_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'INDUSTRY_LICENSE' | 'EU_ECONOMIC_OPERATOR' | ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  jurisdiction    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ISO 3166-1 alpha-2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  issuer          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  credential_no   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_codes     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 覆盖的类目/行业范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  issued_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  -- 'pending'|'verified'|'rejected'|'expired'|'revoked'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verified_checks JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_refs   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_credential (legal_entity_key, credential_type, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_credential (expires_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'verified'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>verified_checks</code> 存四个检查各自的结论与依据，而不是一个总布尔。当监管或商家质询&quot;为什么这份许可证被判不合格&quot;时，能精确回答是哪一项没过。这个字段与 <a href=\"../ubo-controller-due-diligence/ubo-sanctions-aml-interface\">UBO 与制裁/AML 筛查接口</a> 里的 <code>matched_fields</code> 是同一个设计动机：<strong>把复合结论拆成可归因的子结论</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"有效期与到期管理\">有效期与到期管理</h3><p>许可证有到期日，这是资质管理与 <a href=\"../kyb-monitoring-lifecycle/ongoing-monitoring-change-rescreen\">持续监控</a> 的天然接口。到期管理需要三段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>预警期</strong>（如到期前 60 天）：通知商家续期，不改变当前状态。</li>\n<li><strong>宽限期</strong>（可选，按司法管辖区与类目设定）：状态转为 <code>expiring</code>，若平台允许则限制部分功能（如下架受资质约束的类目商品）而不终止合作。</li>\n<li><strong>失效</strong>：状态转为 <code>expired</code>，联动下架受该资质约束的类目。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键取舍是<strong>失效的后果按类目粒度而不是商家粒度</strong>：一家卖多品类的商家，其食品经营许可证到期只应影响食品类目，不应冻结整个店铺。这个粒度决定必须在数据模型上支持——因此 <code>scope_codes</code> 与 <code>category</code> 的关联是资质管理的核心字段。</p>\n<h3 id=\"缺资质的处置策略\">缺资质的处置策略</h3><p>&quot;缺资质&quot;不是一个动作，而是三档：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>该市场该类目强制资质</td>\n<td>阻断，不予上架</td>\n<td>无资质的经营本身就是违法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资质存在但材料不全</td>\n<td>补件，限时提交</td>\n<td>证据缺失不等于资质缺失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资质非强制但监管关注</td>\n<td>放行 + 标记</td>\n<td>过度拦截会误伤合规商家</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三档与 <a href=\"kyb-risk-tier-approval\">KYB 风险分级与入驻审批</a> 的&quot;否决项与加权项分离&quot;是同一原则的两个应用面。资质沟通的另一端是商品维度的资质认证准入管理（相邻 hub，本 hub 不展开）——那边管<strong>单件商品的证书</strong>（某一批货的检测报告、合规声明），本篇管<strong>企业持有许可证的经营资格</strong>，两者的数据源、更新频率与失效后果都不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资质台账的运营面\">资质台账的运营面</h2><h3 id=\"状态机\">状态机</h3><p>资质的生命周期是一个状态机，各状态的迁移必须显式定义并留痕：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"CREDENTIAL_TRANSITIONS = {&#10;    &quot;pending&quot;:   {&quot;verify&quot;: &quot;verified&quot;, &quot;reject&quot;: &quot;rejected&quot;},&#10;    &quot;verified&quot;:  {&quot;expire&quot;: &quot;expired&quot;, &quot;revoke&quot;: &quot;revoked&quot;, &quot;supersede&quot;: &quot;pending&quot;},&#10;    &quot;expired&quot;:   {&quot;renew&quot;: &quot;pending&quot;},&#10;    &quot;rejected&quot;:  {&quot;resubmit&quot;: &quot;pending&quot;},&#10;    &quot;revoked&quot;:   {},                       # 终态，不可恢复&#10;}&#10;&#10;def apply_transition(cred, action, actor, evidence=None):&#10;    nxt = CREDENTIAL_TRANSITIONS.get(cred.status, {}).get(action)&#10;    if nxt is None:&#10;        raise IllegalTransition(f&quot;{cred.status} -/-&gt; {action}&quot;)&#10;    write_audit(cred_id=cred.credential_id, frm=cred.status, to=nxt,&#10;                action=action, actor=actor, evidence=evidence, at=now())&#10;    return nxt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CREDENTIAL_TRANSITIONS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:   {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"verify\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"verified\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reject\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"verified\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:  {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"expire\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"expired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"revoke\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"revoked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supersede\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"expired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:   {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"renew\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:  {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"resubmit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"revoked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:   {},                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 终态，不可恢复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> apply_transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cred, action, actor, evidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    nxt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> CREDENTIAL_TRANSITIONS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.get(cred.status, {}).get(action)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nxt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IllegalTransition(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cred.status</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -/-> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">action</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    write_audit(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cred_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cred.credential_id, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">frm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cred.status, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nxt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">action, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">actor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">actor, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">evidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">evidence, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">now())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nxt</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>revoked</code> 设为终态是刻意的：被吊销的许可证重新提交时应当创建<strong>新的凭证记录</strong>而不是复活旧记录，这样&quot;这家公司曾经被吊销过许可证&quot;这个事实在台账里保留下来。把它设计成可恢复状态会抹掉这段历史，而这段历史在评估商家是否有持续合规问题时价值很高。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与审批的合成\">与审批的合成</h3><p>资质核验的输出进入审批时应当是<strong>结构化的否决项清单</strong>，而不是一个分数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;credential_gate&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;blocked&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;blocking_reasons&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;requirement_id&quot;: &quot;req_EU_GPSR_manufacturer_nonEU&quot;,&#10;        &quot;missing_credential_type&quot;: &quot;EU_ECONOMIC_OPERATOR&quot;,&#10;        &quot;affected_categories&quot;: [&quot;consumer-electronics&quot;]&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;non_blocking_gaps&quot;: [{ &quot;requirement_id&quot;: &quot;req_local_membership&quot;, &quot;note&quot;: &quot;行业自律认证缺失，标记关注&quot; }]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"credential_gate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"blocked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"blocking_reasons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"requirement_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"req_EU_GPSR_manufacturer_nonEU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"missing_credential_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU_ECONOMIC_OPERATOR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"affected_categories\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"consumer-electronics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"non_blocking_gaps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"requirement_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"req_local_membership\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"行业自律认证缺失，标记关注\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>下游的审批引擎只需要判断 <code>blocked</code>，不需要理解资质的具体语义。这种&quot;上游把复合判断收敛成结构化否决项&quot;的模式，在所有风控链路里都比&quot;把分数传给下游自己解释&quot;更可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>经营范围与前置许可是两个不同的门槛：前者是<strong>能力声明</strong>，后者是<strong>进入行业的法定凭证</strong>；两者都必须覆盖目标类目，缺一即资质断裂。</li>\n<li>资质要求应建模为<strong>司法管辖区 × 类目 × 商家角色</strong>三元组的属性，带 <code>severity</code>（硬门槛/软要求）与 <code>grace_period_days</code>（过渡期）。</li>\n<li>跨境场景中<strong>本地代表本身就是一类一等资质</strong>：欧盟 GPSR 要求非欧盟制造商指定欧盟经济运营者（未指定则进口商或分销商自动承担合规责任），IOSS 要求非欧盟企业使用欧盟中介且仅覆盖 0–150 欧元的低价值进口。</li>\n<li>凭证核验拆成四个正交检查（发证机关真实性、主体一致、范围覆盖、有效期），<code>verified_checks</code> 存各检查结论以便归因；<strong>到期后果按类目粒度生效</strong>而非冻结整个店铺。</li>\n<li>资质生命周期是显式状态机，<code>revoked</code> 为终态且重新提交创建新记录以保留历史；输出给审批引擎的是<strong>结构化否决项清单</strong>而非分数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"行业资质与前置经营许可（联109）","id":"行业资质与前置经营许可-联109"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"资质要求的建模","id":"资质要求的建模"},{"level":3,"text":"三层映射：司法管辖区 × 类目 × 商家角色","id":"三层映射-司法管辖区-类目-商家角色"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么要有\"本地代表\"这一类资质","id":"为什么要有-本地代表-这一类资质"},{"level":2,"text":"资质凭证的结构化核验","id":"资质凭证的结构化核验"},{"level":3,"text":"四个必须通过的检查","id":"四个必须通过的检查"},{"level":3,"text":"有效期与到期管理","id":"有效期与到期管理"},{"level":3,"text":"缺资质的处置策略","id":"缺资质的处置策略"},{"level":2,"text":"资质台账的运营面","id":"资质台账的运营面"},{"level":3,"text":"状态机","id":"状态机"},{"level":3,"text":"与审批的合成","id":"与审批的合成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"对公银行账户归属验证（penny drop）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/business-account-qualification/corporate-bank-account-ownership"},"next":{"title":"KYB 风险分级与入驻审批/补件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-kyb-business-verification/business-account-qualification/kyb-risk-tier-approval"}}